WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.520
Game day

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.340
Game day: a big day. Is everything ready?

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.500
On game day, it all starts from the home screen.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.670
A quick look at the opponent report: their record, their form, their pitchers.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.730
Your lineup is ready: export it to PDF.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:26.950
Choose your pages and the number of copies: a sheet for each scorekeeper, one for the umpire.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:35.070
The game sheet comes out filled in: batting order, numbers, positions. Ready for the scorekeepers and the umpire.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:40.640
The bench sheet, and the coach’s field sheet: who plays where, every inning.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:48.110
And at the field, in doubt? Ask UmpBot: it answers from your category’s rulebook, with the article.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:53.520
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
